; Requires current MucoMSX MSX PSG/SCC extensions (msPb0102).
; YM2151 FM -> OPNA FM: A=ch1 B=ch2 C=ch3 H=ch4 I=ch5 J=ch7
; YM2151 FM -> SCC wave+envelope: SCCA=ch6
; K = MSM6258 ADPCM -> ADPCM-B (GRADIUS2.BIN)
; F = tempo only: Timer-B values alternate so 1 clock = 2 driver ticks

